{
  "name": "dsh-usage-dock",
  "version": "0.9.0",
  "description": "套餐用量角标（Slacom 定制版）：在左侧状态栏显示 OpenCode Go / DeepSeek 官网余额 / OpenAI Codex 订阅额度 / 小米 MiMo API 余额 / WorkBuddy 积分，并支持自建「自定义余额渠道」（选择模型来源 + 余额接口路径，可与内置渠道同列混排、失败回退与详情卡片）；含 5小时 / 周限 / 月限窗口与 DeepSeek 峰谷时段条；另带只读模型工具 usage_status 与可选的按渠道额度策略（默认关闭）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "plans",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "slots",
        "configForms"
      ]
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "opencode",
    "usage",
    "quota",
    "balance"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Slacom/dsh-usage-dock.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Slacom/dsh-usage-dock#readme",
  "license": "MIT"
}
